id: pm-xm9t
title: Certify saved typed-binding snapshot hardening against current main
description: "Follow up pm-qz1k by reconciling the saved typed-binding review against main. PR #191 already delivered all saved source and test hunks. Add independent end-to-end regression coverage and isolated behavioral revert proofs for captured binding values, catalog membership and privacy before normalization; preserve subsequent ownership and seed-normalization fixes. Rebuild dist rather than copy saved artifacts. Avoid the open coverage and closeout PR files."
