comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-07T14:35:55.235Z",codex-agent,"Saved-WIP comparison: all four source changes and their artifact-state regressions already landed through PR #191 (d1087cf). No source hunks remain to reapply. Copying the WIP would remove later seed normalization and artifact ownership. Keep main source intact, add focused independent black-box regression coverage and mutation proofs, rebuild dist and run npm/Bun release gates. PR #203 remains open; its implementation, tests and tracker items are excluded. The generated changelog will be refreshed as required after final tracker writes."
  "2026-11-07T14:39:15.993Z",codex-agent,"Focused acceptance passes 4/4 with zero failures or skips. Reproducible disposable-copy revert verifier passes baseline 4/4; kills seven isolated mutations (binding alias, template alias, seed alias, ownership record alias, catalog guard removal, replacement privacy guard removal, sensitive seed-prefix guard removal); all seven restored scenarios pass. No production source was altered: these certify behaviors already delivered by PR #191. Every fixture is synthetic and uses real nongit SDK trackers."
  "2026-11-07T14:45:58.225Z",codex-agent,"Expanded the disposable verifier with a settings-alias mutation: baseline 4/4, now 8/8 independent behavioral reverts fail with assertions and all 8 restorations pass. npm typecheck, lint, build:test and docstrings pass (95 files, 227 declarations). Both linked pm tests passed with result tracking disabled as required; no run artifacts were written to the package tracker. Isolated strict health passes; ordinary host health reports the existing global pm-github version skew. Current source, rebuilt dist and generated CHANGELOG are byte-identical to main; no paths owned by open PR #203 are changed."
  "2026-11-07T14:57:46.146Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates pass on unchanged source at unchanged thresholds: npm run release:check 348/348 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, test duration 418812 ms; bun run release:check 348/348 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations. Both report 100.00% lines/branches/functions across all 36 required source files. Typecheck, lint, docstrings (95 files and 227 declarations), test compilation, production audit, package inspection, changelog and both release verifiers pass. Focused suite passes 4/4. Linked disposable verifier now passes all 8 isolated revert proofs and all 8 restorations. Source, rebuilt dist and generated changelog are identical to main. Only this new issue, its history, focused tests, verifier and verification notes are changed. No saved source/test hunk remains to port because PR #191 already delivered them; saved dist and closed-feature tracker edits are dropped. No merge, package release or bot trigger performed. Item remains in_progress for orchestrator verification; CI will start when the single follow-up PR opens. Existing global extension/host version skew remains outside scope; isolated strict tracker health passes."
